{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d482b0242649c2cd6981bed3e3e7a542eaffc91c1d618dd968e66559ac580eb0","ja":"なんか、控え室の雰囲気、変わった？","zh":"感觉休息室的气氛，是不是变了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8592a5e444a21dbcbcce0c04c511e4182b8fa2ac4338aa708769622b9e0e8d54","ja":"あっ……杏奈、わかったかも……。\nいろんな物が……デコられてる、よ……。","zh":"啊……杏奈，可能明白了……\n很多东西……都被装饰过了，哦……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"27a5dc741a98881bbaf3984f08c501be7141d9a59cdc778f8711dfab75901830","ja":"わぁ……本当だぁ。ペンとか、コップとか……\nあっ、椅子の背もたれまで……。","zh":"哇……真的耶。笔啊、杯子啊……\n啊，连椅子的靠背也是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"51eb0444cf926bc55d49a769d0528e874953eec76b777ce4477ce74aa4817a70","ja":"あはっ☆　ミキたちのデコを見て、\nみんな真似したくなったんだね♪","zh":"啊哈☆ 看到美希她们的装饰，\n大家也都想跟着学了吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"412d894853cf7202d1633ebba19ca56b1c3e783464344fdf5bbfbbf12167e3bd","ja":"ええ、そうなのかい！？　たしかにみんな、\nかわいいって言ってくれてたけども……。","zh":"哎，是这样吗！？虽然大家确实都\n夸过很可爱就是了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2f5ba29e507ed88c0bb685a2467a8396c3051030537e81a14a05132cd8754d17","ja":"それで……劇場がデコでいっぱいに、なるなんて……！\n杏奈たちが……流行を作っちゃった……？","zh":"结果……剧场竟然变得满是饰品……！\n是杏奈她们……引领了潮流吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8151b82df536f464d0628ef9f4850efc829928862c45bc5043833c604b8ce108","ja":"きっとそうなの♪","zh":"一定是这样的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c22086e309404baf3666654bbaee7d84387d7b1940c40ea4d64fe267a6eda246","ja":"みんなも楽しんでるみたいだし、\n劇場もかわいくなって、いいことだって思うな☆","zh":"大家看起来也都很开心，\n剧场也变得可爱起来了，我觉得挺好的呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"318252e9e5a213bb9c00feeb55096c47918ac9c50e4c85546a1cbefa33b3c48e","ja":"えへへ♪　あたしたちがブームの火付け役だなんて、\nちょっこし恥ずかしいけど、嬉しいねぇ。","zh":"嘿嘿♪　说我们掀起了热潮什么的，\n虽然有点不好意思，但还是好开心呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e46b730e6cd74d8e5e8a0bdad9cf43eb45eb622ef2eca0af1868ef13abf495b9","ja":"うん。劇場が……どんどんデコられて……あっ。","zh":"嗯。剧场被……装饰得越来越华丽了……啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f43a32fb6db8e5e1fb4b459c346943020782e6c59ab444e0a157a7be941835b9","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんに注意されない、かな？","zh":"●●●●不会被制作人先生说教吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"25ac233758c002e1cde8ba6ae71b8949f18f78909f0ec1f4b6f23d472ee54aa8","ja":"それは、怒られたときに考えたら\nいいって思うな♪","zh":"我觉得这种事，等被骂了再考虑\n就行啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1331.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1913fafef4d09a259d000085660ee9b6b5ebbfa0e80a5888cd76ec95a6b45322","ja":"それまでは、ミキたちでもっともっと、\n劇場をかわいくデコっちゃお。あはっ☆","zh":"在那之前，美希她们就再多把\n剧场装饰得更可爱一点吧。啊哈☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
